    "paragraph": "Using 2024 survey data from five US transit agencies and four cumulative linked mixed models, researchers measured how fare-free transit users react to fare reinstatements and service alterations. Another study developed the Regulatory Two-Step Virtual Catchment Area model to incorporate cross-border licensure laws into spatial accessibility metrics for telehealth. Finally, an analysis combining high-resolution asset wealth data with hourly temperature records across Africa from 2000 to 2023 demonstrated that extreme heat reduced annual continental asset wealth growth by 2.42%.",
